# 100xSystems — Submissions Directory
#
# Auto-generated review packages (created by `100x submit`) are gitignored.
# Only the directory structure, configuration, and index are tracked.
#
# To add a new system directory for submissions:
#   mkdir -p submissions/<system-name>
#   touch submissions/<system-name>/.gitkeep

# ─── Ignore auto-generated review packages ──────────────────────
# These are timestamped directories created by `100x submit`:
#   submissions/<system>/<author>-<language>-<timestamp>/
#
# The pattern only matches children of system directories (no leading dot),
# so .github/ CI infrastructure is automatically preserved.
[!.]*/*

# ─── But keep .gitkeep files so the directory structure is tracked ─
![!.]*/.gitkeep
